<title>USA: Chrysler December US car sales rise.</title>
<headline>Chrysler December US car sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chrysler Corp</p>
<p>			Dec 1-31, 1996     Dec 1-31, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    57,602	    54,673	     +5.4</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	 122,202	   122,468	     -0.2</p>
<p> Import Car		     0		 662	     N.A.</p>
<p> Import Truck		   0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Dec 31, 1996 Jan 1-Dec 31, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   827,941	   771,357	     +6.6</p>
<p> Domestic Truck     1,618,193	 1,378,163	    +16.7</p>
<p> Import Car		 4,692	    14,823	    -68.6</p>
<p> Import Truck		   0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 25 in latest month vs 25, 308 for year to date vs 306 in year ago.</p>
</text>
